      "message": "You\u0027re right - various discussions online mention this discrepancy. But it looks like GCC (at least GCC \u003e\u003d 13) does have an attribute that works similarly, so perhaps we should switch to that?\n\nhttps://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/gcc/Statement-Attributes.html",
